// Test-suite type-check configuration.
//
// Extends the package tsconfig so the specs stay under the same `strict`
// family as the library, with the two index-signature guards relaxed. Both are
// load-bearing for src/ — the renderer walks a dynamically-shaped `XmlValue`
// record and the parser indexes into the source text by position — and hostile
// to tests, which index into `XmlValue` records by a `@`-prefixed key and
// assert on thrown parse errors, where a null-check at every site would bury
// the thing under test.
//
// The library keeps both guards (see ../tsconfig.json, which covers src/).
// Only the test tree opts out, and only because its input is arbitrary by
// design.
{
  "extends": "../tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature": false, "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": false },
  "include": ["./**/*.ts"]
}
